<section class="card"><h2>Database and photo backups</h2><p class="help">Backups contain the complete database, published content, drafts, staff accounts and uploaded photos. They are stored privately. Automatic backups run nightly; older backups are kept for <?=ae($app->setting('backup_retention_days','30'))?> days.</p><p>Latest verified backup: <?=ae($app->setting('last_backup_at','Not created yet'))?> UTC</p><?php form_start('backup','backup');?><button>Create and verify backup now</button></form><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Backup</th><th>Size</th><th>Download</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach(array_slice($backupFiles,0,30)as $file):?><tr><td><?=ae(basename($file))?></td><td><?=number_format(filesize($file)/1048576,2)?> MB</td><td><a href="<?=ae(au('backup',['download'=>basename($file)]))?>">Download</a></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><p class="help">Backups contain personal information and account password hashes. Keep downloads in a secure place. Recovery is performed with the documented server recovery tool.</p></section>
